<b>Tsukimura-san.</b>

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.120
<b>That was close.</b>

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:54.330
<b>I want it grilled. It's yummier that way...</b>

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:58.460
<b>How am I supposed to sleep?</b>

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:10.550
<b>What's wrong, Ninomiya-kun?</b>

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:12.640
<b>Didn't you sleep well?</b>

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.400
<b>No, it's not that.</b>

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.900
<b><i>Is my daily life gonna continue to be like this?</i></b>

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.250
<b>I see.</b>

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:46.510
<b>Clear my mind. Calm down.</b>

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:53.140
<b>Is there a reason why you are doing that?</b>

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:58.690
<b>Yes, I can suppress my succubus power if I stay calm.</b>

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:02.650
<b>I don't want to keep causing you problems.</b>

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.530
<b>Well, about that.</b>

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.610
<b>I'll do what I can to help you.</b>

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.540
<b>Sure.</b>

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.550
<b>Good morning.</b>

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:24.210
<b>Good day.</b>

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:27.300
<b>Good morning, Reika-san.</b>

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.260
<b>Good morning.</b>

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:30.130
<b>Good day.</b>

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.650
<b>Is senpai checking on public morals starting today?</b>

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.070
<b>Ninomiya Shungo.</b>

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.950
<b>How about a moment of your time for pleasantries?</b>

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:51.070
<b>Ah, hello.</b>

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:52.490
<b>Good morning.</b>

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.580
<b>Ah, thanks!</b>

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.700
<b>Looks like this tradition will resume again every morning.</b>

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:59.660
<b>Houjou-senpai's pushiness with Ninomiya, huh?</b>

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:03.550
<b>But why is she so pushy with him?</b>

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:07.170
<b>I'm in a hurry so I've gotta go.</b>

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.470
<b>Hold it!</b>

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:13.850
<b>Is there something else?</b>

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:20.270
<b>You dare avoid talking to Houjou Reika, the president of the Jinguji Academy student council and...</b>

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.480
<b>heiress to the Houjou Corporation.</b>

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.810
<b>You think you can get away with that kind of greeting?</b>

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.780
<b>Very well then.</b>

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:31.240
<b>By the way, who's the girl?</b>

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:35.370
<b>Well, she's a transfer student. Tsukimura...</b>

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.160
<b>I'm Tsukimura Mayu. Nice to meet you.</b>

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.620
<b>How polite.</b>

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.710
<b>I'm Houjou Reika.</b>

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:47.380
<b>"Houjou Reika." That sounds like a name from an unsaleable girl's manga.</b>

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.840
<b>And that girl would always keep failing.</b>

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:55.390
<b>She probably just can't understand the situation, or is just brain damaged.</b>

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.810
<b>Anyways, she would just be totally worthless.</b>

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.100
<b>Are you trying to pick a fight with me?</b>

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:03.730
<b>No, she isn't.</b>

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.270
<b>What's wrong, Tsukimura-san?</b>

