00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.710
<b>That's a really bad thing to do so early in the morning!</b>

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:27.960
<b>Hosaka-senpai?</b>

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.920
<b>Why you, Hosaka!</b>

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:33.140
<b>Are you planning to interfere, you lowly attendant?</b>

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.140
<b>Ninomiya-kun, now's your chance.</b>

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.850
<b>Sorry, Hosaka-senpai.</b>

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:40.100
<b>Eh? I...</b>

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.100
<b>Tsukimura-san, hurry.</b>

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:45.520
<b>Hosaka, if you understand, then get your grubby hands off of me!</b>

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:47.730
<b>Hosaka!!</b>

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.740
<b>What's wrong with her?</b>

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.280
<b>What's wrong with that girl?</b>

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.370
<b>What happened to you earlier?</b>

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:07.000
<b>Forgive me. After I heard Reika-san's voice, my mind just went blank.</b>

