00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:13.010
<b>The transfer student is going to introduce herself.</b>

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:16.640
<b>I'm Tsu-Tsukimura Mayu-yu!</b>

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:19.310
<b>I made a mistake...</b>

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.100
<b><i>I can sympathise with what she's gonna face.</i></b>

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.360
<b>What's wrong? You're awfully quiet.</b>

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:34.860
<b>Really?</b>

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:38.910
<b>Ninomiya, aren't you looking forward to P.E.?</b>

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:44.580
<b>You guys can still make it!</b>

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:47.500
<b>As men, the path you're taking is wrong!</b>

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.720
<b>Ayakawa-san, please, let me get to Tsukimura.</b>

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:02.350
<b>Well, this is self-restraint too.</b>

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:03.430
<b>Okay, girls...</b>

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:04.440
<b>get him!!</b>

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.310
<b>It's so hard.</b>

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.430
<b>Nice.</b>

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:10.440
<b>Hey, don't grab there!</b>

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.730
<b>Well, it's like that, Ninomiya.</b>

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:14.700
<b>You enjoy yourself.</b>

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.860
<b>Don't touch Tsukimura-san!</b>

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.570
<b>I'm saying this for your own good!</b>

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.160
<b>Still acting like her knight.</b>

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.830
<b>We know you want her for yourself.</b>

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.330
<b>Mayu-chan, what's your type of guy?</b>

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:33.250
<b>Give me your number.</b>

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.920
<b>Hey, no touching!</b>

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.840
<b>Stop pushing! I'm gonna fall!</b>

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:41.930
<b>Mayu-chan.</b>

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:44.350
<b>If you'd like, let's go to the karaoke box on the way home today.</b>

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.510
<b>Hold it!</b>

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.440
<b>My, my. What a mess.</b>

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.810
<b>Please stop. I'm begging you.</b>

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.720
<b><i>I'm fine.</i></b>

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:27.970
<b>Why are you doing this?</b>

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.730
<b>Why are you doing all this?</b>

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:33.150
<b><i>It's because you...</i></b>

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.450
<b>Tsukimura-san?</b>

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.080
<b>It's Shungo-kun!</b>

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.790
<b>Hey! Tsukimura-san?</b>

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.890
<b>Hey! That's...</b>

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:29.210
<b>Is this what you do everytime you're in the infirmary?</b>

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.040
<b>Nee-san{Sis}?</b>

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.960
<b>All you do is make my job hard. Sheesh.</b>

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:36.830
<b>Nee-san{Sis}, why are you at school?</b>

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:38.210
<b>And those clothes?</b>

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:40.220
<b>I said that I was working, right?</b>

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:40.880
<b>Working?</b>

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:44.890
<b>Right. Starting today, I'll be the school nurse.</b>

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.390
<b>I'm not going to let you have your way with her.</b>

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.180
<b>And another problem arises.</b>

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:09.620
<b>It seems like Tsukimura-san is living together with Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:17.420
<b>That little wench! What am I going to do with her?</b>

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.590
<b>That girl...</b>

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.260
<b>Jealousy?</b>

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:27.430
<b>Who are you?</b>

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.350
<b>How long have you been there?</b>

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:32.430
<b>Well, that doesn't matter, does it?</b>

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:36.690
<b>More importantly, would you like to play a game with us?</b>

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:06.300
<b>That's right.</b>

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:09.470
<b>There's no way I could possibly lose.</b>

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.600
<b>Ojou-sama, let's stop this.</b>

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.940
<b>Keep your mouth shut, Hosaka.</b>

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:18.730
<b>I cannot show my back to an enemy.</b>

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:22.780
<b>If you're interested in Ninomiya-kun, aren't there other ways to go about it?</b>

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:26.320
<b>How is that man involved?</b>

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:30.280
<b>All I want is to restore order to the school.</b>

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:33.700
<b>But, the point is, you're not very honest with yourself.</b>

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.910
<b>Ah, no, this is...</b>

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.330
<b>Ojou-sama, no!!</b>

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.890
<b>Say, Shungo-san...</b>

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:59.150
<b>I want you.</b>

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:05.400
<b>What are you saying, Mayu?</b>

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:06.150
<b>We don't...</b>

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.150
<b>Cut!</b>

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:11.400
<b>What's with that radish-like acting? That makes the training pointless.</b>

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.240
<b>Don't be nervous, Mayu-chan.</b>

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.410
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:18.160
<b>And you Shungo, you're too stiff!</b>

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.750
<b>If you don't take this seriously...</b>

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:24.210
<b>I'll make you fight mysterious, underground dwelling cannibals in a savage land.</b>

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:24.880
<b>Naked!</b>

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.090
<b>Look here, Nee-san{sis}.</b>

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.300
<b>On top of not being able to sleep much last night...</b>

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:33.560
<b>my housework is piling up from this ruckus here.</b>

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:34.930
<b>So?</b>

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:38.430
<b>At least let me devote my time to the house during my days off.</b>

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:39.560
<b>Rejected.</b>

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.390
<b>Let's continue. Start!</b>

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:50.780
<b>Hold me.</b>

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:02.540
<b>How can you two do such lewd things in broad daylight?</b>

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.670
<b>Houjou-senpai? Why are you in my house?</b>

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:09.840
<b>As I expected, the culprit is Tsukimura Mayu.</b>

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:10.930
<b>It's you!</b>

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:17.390
<b>To maintain the order and morals of Jinguji Academy...</b>

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:19.640
<b>I challenge you!</b>

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.560
<b>Challenge me?</b>

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:24.310
<b>My, that's interesting.</b>

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:27.690
<b>This is a good opportunity, Mayu. Accept her challenge.</b>

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.610
<b>That's right.</b>

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:34.780
<b>Then, will you allow us to set the rules of the challenge?</b>

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:35.740
<b>Okay?</b>

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.070
<b>I don't mind.</b>

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:40.500
<b>No matter the challenge, there's no way I could be defeated.</b>

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.040
<b>But, don't forget your promise.</b>

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.870
<b>I got it.</b>

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:48.210
<b>If Mayu loses, I'll keep my end of the bargain and we'll leave the Ninomiya residence.</b>

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.760
<b>How did it turn out like this?</b>

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.840
<b>You sure have it tough too, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:56.720
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:03.480
<b>We shall now commence the three challenges to win over Ninomiya Shungo.</b>

